        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shogi, the classic Japanese game of strategy, has been reborn. Welcome to Real-Time Shogi, where the ancient board game collides with the blistering speed of modern action games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget waiting for your turn. In this game, you and your opponent move your pieces simultaneously in a constant flow of attack and defense. Victory demands more than just deep strategy; it requires quick thinking, sharp reflexes, and the ability to make split-second decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the traditional pieces, anticipate your opponent's moves, and unleash your strategy in a dynamic, ever-shifting battlefield. This is a true test of mind and wit, where hesitation means defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you fast enough to claim checkmate?</p>",
